factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says Karthikeyan was summoned 'இன்று' (today) and was sent back by police, but the article says he was summoned for today (Nov 16) and was turned back yesterday (நேற்று) when the ADSP was absent; the reel_script wrongly conflates these, and the caption's 'இன்று (நவ. 16) விசாரணைக்கு ஆஜராக' also mismatches the article's date of the turn-back.
  The reel_script calls the official 'காவல் கண்காணிப்பாளர்' (SP) office and the caption and slides call it 'எஸ்.பி. அலுவலகம்', but the article says the summons was at the Trichy SP office, which is consistent; however the reel_script adds 'கூடுதல் காவல் கண்காணிப்பாளர் மதியழகன்' whereas the article names him as ADSP (ஏ.டி.எஸ்.பி.) Madhiyazhagan, a title mismatch.
  The reel_script says the summoned person was 'வக்கீலுடன்' and mentions the lawyer name correctly, but states the police sent him to 'வேறு நாளில்' while the reel_script's first sentence says he was 'விசாரணைக்கு வரவழைக்கப்பட்ட' and turned back today, mixing two different days into one narrative.
  The reel_script states Ravisankar was attacked with the son providing a stick ('கட்டை எடுத்துக் கொடுக்க, அதாலும் தாக்கினார்'), and the caption says 'மகன் மீதும்' legal action is demanded; the article only says the complainant demands legal action against 'அவர்கள்' (them), so the caption's specific claim about the son is an added detail not clearly grounded in the article's stated demand.
  The reel_script's first sentence says the complainant 'புகார் அளித்தார்' and then the sentence 'இன்று விசாரணைக்கு வரவழைக்கப்பட்ட அவரை, போலீசார் வேறு நாளுக்கு வருமாறு திருப்பி அனுப்பினர்' describes today's turn-back, which contradicts the article's timeline (turn-back was yesterday, Nov 15, with the summons for today).
